your early days on the show,

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.541
what was your first week like?

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:09.876 size:81% position:41%
-My -- I have no idea.

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:12.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like I don´t remember
my first year.

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:13.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It was all --

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.715
